{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34400","headline":"奉和袭美题达上人药圃二首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美题达上人药圃二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"净名无语示清羸，药草搜来喻更微。\n一雨一风皆遂性，花开花落尽忘机。\n教疏兔镂金弦乱，自拥龙刍紫汞肥。\n莫怪独亲幽圃坐，病容销尽欲依归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}